          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakam 21:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 33:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akaragira Hirikiya nyakatagara omukuru, abanyakatagara abaamukonyeraga, n'abalinzi abaalindaga omulyango baturukye ebikwato byona ebyakoliirwe Baali, Asera, n'ebintu ebindi byona ebinyakuli omu mwanya; ebikwato ebi yabyokeza aheeru ya Yerusaalemu haihi n'ekihanga kya Kederoni, iju eryabirugiremu yalitwara Beseeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baanyakatagara abaaramyaga ebisisani, abaatairweho abakama ba Yuda okucumikirra obubbani omu birorro ebikaba biri omu mbuga za Yuda n'okwehinguliriza Yerusaalemu, n'abo abaacumiikirraga Baali, izooba, okwezi, enyunyuuzi, n'ebintu byona eby'omu mwanya, yababinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekisisani ky'Asera, akakiiha omunju ya MUKAMA, yakiturukya orubuga Yerusaalemu, yakitwara ha kisaaru Kederoni, nuho yakyokeza. Yakihondahonda kyona kyafooka cuucu, ecuucu egi yagimiisa ha bituuro eby'abantu abatali b'ekitiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiikaro ebikaba biri omunju ya MUKAMA ebyaraarwamuga baamalaaya, yabiseesa; (oku, ebyokujwara ebyajwarwaga abantu obu baabaga nibaramya Asera, abakazi nuho baabirukiraga). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baanyakatagara boona abakaba bali omu mbuga za Yuda akabaihamu, ebirorro banyakatagara ebi baacumiikirirrahoga obubbaani, okuruga Geeba okuhika Beeriseba yabisiisa, ebirorro eby'amalembo ebikaba biri ha ntaaho ey'irembo lya Yoswa omulemi w'orubuga, ebikaba biri ha mukono gw'obumoso ha irembo ly'orubuga yabiseesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu banyakatagara ab'ebiikaro ebi bakaba batarukwikirizibwa kuheereza omunju ya MUKAMA, kyonka baikirizibwaga kulya omugaati ogutatumbisiibwe ogwaleeterwaga banyakatagara bagenzi baabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 7:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.19.1+JER.19.2+JER.19.3+JER.19.4+JER.19.5+JER.19.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.32.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akahagaza ekiikaro Tofesi ekikaba kiri omu kihanga ekya batabani ba Hinoomu, nukwo haleke kubaho omuntu n'omu ow'arukusobora kwokya mutabani we rundi muhara we, kuba kihongwa eky'okwokya eky'okuhongera Moleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embaraasi ezaikaraga ha mulyango ogwatwaraga omunju ya MUKAMA, haihi n'ekisiika kya Nasani-Meleki omukonwa, abakama ba Yuda ezi bakaba bahongiire izooba, akaziita, ekigaali yakyokya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakam 21:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 33:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amatambiro agakaba gali ha rusu orw'ekisiika eky'eruguru eky'Ahazi, abakama ba Yuda aga bakaba bakozire, amatambiro Manaase aga akaba akozire omu bikaali bibiri eby'enju ya MUKAMA, ebi byona akabiseesa yabisasangura, ecuucu yabyo yagiseesa omu kisaaru Kederoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 11:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiikaro ebikuru ebikaba biri ha bukiizi obw'emoso obwa Yerusaalemu, nootoma omuhanda ogurukutwara ha bukiizi obw'obulyo obw'orusozi orw'obubi, Solomooni Omukama wa Isirairi ebi akaba ayombekiire Asitarosi ayahugisaaga Abasidoni, Kemosi ayanugisaaga Abamowabbu, na Mirikomu ayanugisaaga Abamooni, Omukama akabihagaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomyo yagicwacwana, ebisisani by'Asera yabitematema, omu biikaro byabyo yaijuzaamu amagufa g'abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
