          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyakimu akaha Faraaho efeeza na zaabbu, baitu akaragira abantu bahe omusoro Faraaho ogu yabacweriire. Abantu boona ab'omunsi egi, akabaihaho efeeza na zaabbu ey'okuha Faraaho Neeko, buli omu nkooku akaba acweriirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.35",
